1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,160
Narrator: Listen to an announcement on the school intercom.

2
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:05,290
Teacher: Hello, everyone.

3
00:00:05,290 --> 00:00:09,030
All student report cards were handed out today.

4
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:12,240
These report cards need to be signed by your parents

5
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:15,080
and brought back to school as soon as possible.

6
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:18,110
When you are leaving school, check the bulletin boards.

7
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:21,010
We've posted the list for the honor roll.

8
00:00:21,010 --> 00:00:25,080
Many of you will be happy to see your names on the list.
